    {
      "id": "ac03a49e-2a40-4b43-b512-3b30d6b62b0b",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## E-commerce Order Tracker + FAQ Bot - 15 Nodes\n\n### How it works\n\n1. The workflow triggers whenever a new message is received via Telegram.\n2. It uses an AI model to analyze the user's intent and routes the request based on whether it concerns order status or FAQs.\n3. Depending on the intent, it either fetches order data from Google Sheets or queries FAQ data to generate an appropriate response using AI.\n4. The conversation details are logged to a Google Sheets document, and the final response is sent back to the user on Telegram.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- - [ ] Configure Telegram Bot credentials and connect the Telegram Trigger and Send Reply nodes.\n- - [ ] Connect your Google Gemini API key to the AI intent detection and FAQ answering nodes.\n- - [ ] Set up a Google Sheets document with appropriate sheets for orders, FAQs, and conversation logs, and configure the Google Sheets nodes accordingly.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can add more branches to handle specific customer service queries or integrate additional AI tools for multi-language support."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
